    Bug 1917827 - Add `isUserAction` option to some message operations, to enable undo and some other UI related feedback features. r=aleca

    The WebExtension copy/move functions are often used for batch operations
    in the background. However, there are also cases where add-ons want to
    act on behalf of the user and need to trigger the same actions as if the
    message was manually copied/moved by the user.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D236719

